  "Fights With What He Made": {
   "rule": "The Xích Kim Furnace, full set: when you block a hit, your Sword's next strike comes hot from the furnace: it deals 30 % more damage, ignores 95 resistance points (~20 % of a typical ward) and adds 2 Metal stacks (8 s).",
   "approx": "ignores 20 % of the target's defence is modelled as pen 95 (resistance penetration in points, ~20 % of a Kết Đan foe's typical ~479 ward points), since engine `pierce` only pierces realm suppression.",
